    "title": "KJP's Knowledge on North Korea",
    "text": "• KJP refers to Karine Jean-Pierre, the White House Press Secretary.\n• KJP has been involved in discussions regarding North Korea's nuclear program.\n• She has addressed questions from the press about North Korea's missile tests.\n• KJP has emphasized the Biden administration's commitment to diplomacy with North Korea.\n• She has stated that the U.S. is prepared to respond to any provocations from North Korea.\n• KJP has highlighted the importance of working with allies in addressing North Korean threats.",
